      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer - Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\n\nImmediate Offers, in excess of 500,000 invited, for this magnificent, high specification detached residence. \n\n\nOccupying circa 3 acres of beautifully stocked, landscaped gardens together with grazing paddock, located just north of Newtowngore, circa 10km from Ballinamore & Carrigallen and circa 31km from Cavan.\n\n\nThis circa 377m2 house is truly an exceptional offering in terms of accommodation, fit-out and aspect.\n\n\nOffers are immediately invited for a period ending 30th September.\n\n\nFor arrangements to view or further information, please contact Liam Farrell, of Sherry FitzGerald Farrell, on 087 2727 989 during business hours."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 26.67m2\n“Stone” flag ceramic floor tiling with a central feature design, bespoke open-thread staircase, Georgian-style dental coving, ceiling rose with a five-lamp light fitting and matching wall sconces. Glazed front door with matching glazed side panels, curtain pole and drapes, wall-mounted picture light, and radiator.\n\nReception Room - 5.64m x 5.45m\nFeature box bay window with quality upholstered pelmet, drapes & tie-backs, complemented by inner drapes. Wood flooring, decorative coving and centre rose with bronze candelabra. Fireplace with marble surround and hearth, granite inset and solid-fuel inset stove. Radiators x 2. The room enjoys gorgeous pastoral views over surrounding rolling fields.\n\nLiving Room - 5.82m x 5.44m\nFeature box bay window with upholstered pelmet, drapes & tie backs and inner drapes. Wooden floor, Bespoke bar cabinet unit with Baumatic wine cooler & wine rack. Coal effect electric stove with Portuguese limestone fire surround, radiator, coving & ornate centre rose, 6 lamp \"antique\" bronze & opaline light fittings.\n\nSun Room - 4.38m x 3.96m\nWood flooring, full window glazing with upholstered pelmet and drapes, vaulted ceiling with 3 lamp bronze & opaline light fitting.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 6.39m x 4.75m\n\"Stone\" flag ceramic floor tiling, coving, fitted bespoke oak units with granite worktops and splashbacks, Rangemaster 110 cooker with ceramic hob, Franke sink & basin, Bosch integrated dishwasher, Whirlpool integrated fridge, radiators x 2, bronze 5 lamp light fittings x 2, French doors with curtain pole, drapes & tie backs leading out to raised patio, windows x 2 with roller blinds. Double doors and side lights with bevelled glass glazing, fitted bespoke corner cabinet.\n\nUtility Room - 3.60m x 2.66m\n\" Stone\" flag floor tiling, fitted oak base & cupboard units, Belling touch control electric hob, Bosch \"larder\" freezer, Miele dryer, Zanussi 10kg washer, radiator, heat/water control box, alarm, window with roller blind, glazed door leading out to extensive carport area.\n\nBathroom - 3.53mx 2.18m\nFully tiled, window with Roman blind, chrome pole & curtains, coving, chrome wall cabinet, chrome \"wave\" mirror with lights, chrome fittings, Jacuzzi bath with chrome mixer tap and hand spray, wc & whb.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4m x 3.54m\nWood flooring, coving, window with metal pole & curtains views of rear garden and paddock. \"Antique\" brass and opaline ceiling light fitting, radiator. Bespoke wardrobe, chest and dressing table unit.\n\nEnsuite - 2.36m x 1.36m\nTiled, walk in shower/wet room with Mira elite shower, chrome wall fittings, wall cabinet, wall mirror & lamps.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding Area - 53.88m2\nWood flooring, window to front enjoying most pleasant views, curtain pole, drapes & tie backs, coving, centre rose with 5 lamp ceiling light fitting, wall picture light and wall sconces x 2. Walk in linen cupboards x 2, with laundry chute. Access to roof space.\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.47m x 4m\nWood flooring, wallpaper feature, window x 2 with chrome pole & drapes. Fitted dressing table with chest & wardrobe units, chrome 5 lamp light fitting, tv point, radiator.\n\nEnsuite - 3.37m x 1.48m\nFully tiled, roof aperture with electrically operated Velux window, radiator, chrome fittings, corner unit & wall shelf, wall mirror with lights, corner power shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 5m x 3.55m\nWood flooring, built in wardrobes & chest, window with chrome pole & curtains, ceiling track lighting, radiator.\n\nEnsuite - \nFully tiled, corner shower enclosure, cabinet, wall mirror, radiator, wc&whb.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.66m x 3.86m\nWood flooring, built in wardrobes & chest units, window with chrome curtain pole & curtains - views of rear garden, tv point, radiator, 5 lamp light fitting.\n\nEnsuite - 2.82m x 2m\nFully tiled, corner shower enclosure, cabinet, wall mirrors x 2, wall shelf, radiator, window with chrome pole & tie backs.\n\nBedroom 5 - 4.58m x 3.94m\nWood flooring, curtain pole & drapes, 3 lamp ceiling light fitting, radiator, built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 2.67m x 2.46m\nFully tiled, corner shower enclosure with power shower, wall cabinet with shelving, illuminated wall mirror, wc & whb.\n\nEXTERNAL - \n:* Pointed natural stone front boundary wall with wrought iron gates, side and rear boundary defined by post & rail fencing. * Extensive asphalt driveway and parking aprons.* Manicured lawns with a superb collection of mature deciduous trees providing wonderful colour and shade where required. * Barbecue area together with evergreen topiary, flower & shrub beds, raised beds and numerous other landscaping features of note.\n\nCovered Car Porch - 16m x 1.80m\nTo rear of property together with recessed, covered space with power socket.\n\nWC - 1.47m x 1.39m\nWC fully tiled with wall mirror, wc & whb.\n\nHome Office - 4.28m x 4m\nPower & telecom trunking, shelving.\n\nPlant Room - 3.52m x 2m\nHigh output kerosene oil boiler, insulated water tank, window.\n\nStairs to Roof Den - 33m2\nSuitable as games/ recreation room, Velux roof lights, radiator, access to roof space.\n\nDetached Garage - 10m x 6.57m\nElectric roller door and side access - water purifier system, hose reel. To side of garage is area plumbed and prepared for a car wash system.\n\nGENERAL - \n:* OFCH* Solid Fuel Stove* Wired for external generator back up* Broadband connection available * Pumped Sewerage System * Private Well Supply* Security Alarm & Camera System\n\nADDITIONAL - \n:These particulars have been prepared by Sherry FitzGerald Farrell and whilst every care has been taken to ensure that these are accurate and correct, we are not responsible for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, if the property is let, sold or withdrawn from sale or if it is not suitable for your purpose. These particulars are for information only and are given under the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract. Neither whole nor any part of this document or any reference thereto may be included in any public document, circular or statement nor published without the written consent of Sherry FitzGerald Farrell.\n\n"
      },
